3865   EQ29(i,z,time)          Government receipts of indirect taxes on commodity i
3866   EQ30(i,zj,z,time)       Government receipts of indirect taxes on imports of commodity i
3867   EQ31(i,z,zj,time)       Government receipts of indirect taxes on exports of commodity i
3868   EQ32(z,time)            Government savings
3869   EQ33(z,time)            Rest of the world total income
3870   EQ34(z,time)            Rest of the world savings
3871   EQ35(z,time)            Equivalence between current account balance and savings
3872   EQ36(i,z,time)          Household consumption of commodity i
3873   EQ37(i,z,time)          Final demand of commodity i for investment purposes
3874   EQ38(i,z,time)          Public final consumption of commodity i
3875  * CALEQ2(z,time)         Current government expenditures on goods and services
3876   EQ39(i,z,time)          Total intermediate consumption of commodity i
3877   EQ39_1(i,z,time)        Total intermediate consumption of commodity i
3878   EQ39_2(i,z,time)        Total intermediate consumption of commodity i
3879  * EQ40_1(j,z)            CET between different commodities produced by industry j
3880  * EQ40_2(j,i,z)          Industry j production of commodity i (CET)
3881   EQ40_3(i,z,time)        Domestic supply by commdities
3882   EQ40_4(j,z,time)        Total supply by commdities
3883   EQ40_5(i,z,time)        CET function between exports local production and margins
3884   EQ41(i,z,time)          Supply of composite exports
3885   EQ42(i,z,time)          Supply of margins
3886   EQ43(i,z,time)          CET function between exports by trading partner
3887   EQ44(i,z,zj,time)       Supply of exports by trading partner
3888   EQ45(i,z,time)          CES function between composite imports and local production
3889   EQ46(i,z,time)          Demand for composite imports
3890   EQ47(i,z,time)          CES function between imports by origin
3891   EQ48(i,zj,z,time)       Demand for imports by origin
3892   EQ49(j,z,time)          Producer price in energy industries j after production taxes
3893   EQ49_1(j,z,time)        Producer price in industry j after production taxes
3894  * EQ49_2(j,i,z)          Total producer price is equal to P if there is only one product
3895  * EQ49_3(j,i,z)          Basic price of industry j's production of commodity i
3896   EQ50(j,z,time)          Basic price of industry j production
3897   EQ51(j,z,time)          Price index of industry j intermediate consumption
3898  *Simple Nesting
3899  * EQ51_1(j,z,time)
3900  *Nested CES
3901   EQ51_1(j2,z,time)
3902   EQ51_2(j3,z,time)
3903   EQ51_3(j2,z,time)
3904   EQ51_3(j2,z,time)
3905   EQ51_4(j2,z,time)
3906   EQ51_5(j2,z,time)
3907   EQ51_6(j2,z,time)
3908   EQ52(j,z,time)          Value added price
3909   EQ52_1(j,z,time)        KLE price
3910   EQ53(j,z,time)          Price of composite labor in industry j (redundant)
3911  * EQ53_1(j,z,time)       TIW Share
3912  * EQ53_1(k,j,z,time)     TIK Share
3913  * EQ54(l,j,z,time)       Wages including taxes
3914   EQ54(j,z,time)          Wages including taxes
3915   EQ54_1(ene,j,z,time)    energy commodity prices
3916  * EQ55(j,z)              Price of composite capital in industry j (redundant)
3917   EQ56(k,j,z,time)        Rental rate including taxes
3918  * EQ57(k,j,z,time)       Rate of remuneration of capital k (capital mobile)
3919   EQ58(i,z,time)          Producer price is a weighted sum of PE and PL
3920  * EQ59(i,z)              Price of composite export i (redundant)
3921   EQ60(i,z,zj,time)       Border price of exported commodity i
3922   EQ61(i,z,time)          Price of local product i (including all taxes and margins)
3923   EQ62(i,zj,z,time)       Price of imported commodity i (including all taxes and duties)
3924  * EQ63(i,z)              Price of composite import i (redundant)
3925   EQ64(i,z,time)          Consumer price is a weighted sum of PD and PM
3926  * EQ65(z,time)           Aggregate price of capital
3927   EQ66(z,time)            GDP deflator (Fischer index)
3928   EQ67(time)              World GDP deflator (Fischer index)
3929   EQ68(z,time)            Consumer price index (Laspeyres)
3930   EQ69(z,time)            Investment price index (derived from investment function)
3931   EQ70(z,time)            Public expenditure price index
3932   EQ71(i1,z,time)         Domestic absorbtion
3933   EQ71_2(i3,z,time)       Domestic absorbtion
3934  * EQ72(l,z,time)         Labor supply equals labor demand
3935   EQ72(z,time)            Labor supply equals labor demand
3936   EQ73(k,z,time)          Capital supply equals capital demand
3937   EQ74(z,time)            Total investment equals total savings
3938   EQ75(z,time)            Depreciation
3939   EQ76(i,z,time)          Supply of domestic production equals demand
3940   EQ77(i,z,zj,time)       Exports supply equals imports demand
3941   EQ78(i,z,zj,time)       Exports price equals imports price
3942   EQ79(i,time)            World demand for margins equals world supply
3943  * EQ80                   Sum of foreign savings equals zero (redundant)
3944   EQ81(z,time)            GDP at basic prices
3945   EQ82(z,time)            GDP at market prices
3946   EQ83(z,time)            GDP at market prices (income-based)
3947   EQ84(z,time)            GDP at market prices (expenditure-based)
3948   EQ85(time)              World GDP
3949   EQ86(z,time)            Real consumption budget of type h households
3950   EQ87(z,time)            Real current government expenditures on goods and services
3951   EQ88(z,time)            Real GDP at basic prices
3952   EQ89(time)              Real world GDP at basic prices
3953   EQ90(z,time)            Real GDP at market prices
3954   EQ91(z,time)            Real gross fixed capital formation
3955   EQ92(z,time)            Current account balance of region z in terms of the reference currency
3956  * EQ93                    fictitious OBJ. fuction
3957   WALRAS(z,time)          Walras law verification
3958  * EQB_1(i,z)             Top Nest - CES function Aggregated acitivty
3959  * EQB_2(j,i,z)           Top Nest - CES function Aggregated acitivty
3960  * EQB_3(j,i,z)           Total producer price is equal to P if there is only one product
3961  * EQB_4(j,i,z)           Basic price of industry j's production of commodity i
3962  * EQB_5(j,i,z)           Supply of exports for compsite activity
3963   EQA_1(z,time)           Top Nest - Leontief function Aggregated-Electricity
3964   EQA_2(Z,time)           Top Nest - Leontief function Aggregated-Electricity
3965   EQA_3(z,time)           Second Nest - CES function - Aggregated-Electricity
3966   EQA_4(power,i,z,time)   Second Nest - CES function - Aggregated-Electricity
3967   EQB_1(i2,z,time)        Industry j production of commodity i (CES)
3968   EQB_3(j,i,z,time)       Total producer price is equal to P if there is only one product
3969   EQB_4(j,i,z,time)       Basic price of industry js production of commodity i
3970   EQB_5(j,i,z,time)       Supply of exports for compsite activity
3971   EQ94(z,time)            Total investment expenditure constraint
3972   EQ95(z,time)            Aggregate price of capital
3973   EQ96(k,bus,z,time)      Investment demand by industry
3974  *CALEQ3(k,pub,z,time)   Public investment demand
3975   EQ97a(z,time)           Interest rate (weighted average rate of return on capital)
3976   EQ97b(z,time)           User cost of capital
3977   EQ98(i3,z,time)
3978   EQ99(i3,z,time)
3979   EQ100(j,z,time)
3980   EQ101(j,z,time)
3981   EQ102(k,j,z,time)
3982   EQ103(i3,z,time)
3983   EQ104(i3,z,time)
3984   EQ105(i3,z,time)
3985   EQ106(z,time)           labor supply
3986   EQ107(j,z,time)
3987   EQ108(z,time)
3988   EQ108_1(time)
3989   EQ109(z,time)
3990   EQ110(j,z,time)
3991   EQ111(j,z,time)
3992   EQ112(j,z,time)
3993   EQ113(j,z,time)
3994   EQ114(j,z,time)
3995   EQ115(j,z,time)
3996   EQ116(j,z,time)
3997   EQ117(j,z,time)
3998  ;
3999   
4000  *==============================================================================
4001  *  5.3 Equations
4002  *==============================================================================
4003  *   5.3.1 Production
4004  *==============================================================================
4005   EQ1(j3,z,t)..     VA(j3,z,t) =e= v(j3,z)*XST(j3,z,t);
4006   
4007   EQ1_1(j2,z,t)..   KLE(j2,z,t) =e= v2(j2,z)*XST(j2,z,t);
4008   
4009   EQ2(j,z,t)..      CI(j,z,t) =e= io(j,z)*XST(j,z,t);
4010   
4011   EQ2_1(j3,z,t)..   CE(j3,z,t) =e= io2(j3,z)*XST(j3,z,t);
4012   
4013   EQ3(j,z,t)..      VA(j,z,t) =e= A_VA(z,t)*B_VA_t(j,z,t)*{
4014                      [beta_VA(j,z)*LDC(j,z,t)**(-rho_VA(j,z))]$LDCO(j,z)
4015                     +[(1-beta_VA(j,z))*KDC(j,z,t)**(-rho_VA(j,z))]$KDCO(j,z)
4016                                                     }**(-1/rho_VA(j,z));
4017   
4018   EQ3_1(j2,z,t)..   KLE(j2,z,t) =e= B_KLE(j2,z)*{
4019                      [beta_KLE(j2,z)*VA(j2,z,t)**(-rho_KLE(j2,z))]$VAO(j2,z)
4020                     +[(1-beta_KLE(j2,z))*CE(j2,z,t)**(-rho_KLE(j2,z))]$CEO(j2,z)
4021                                                     }**(-1/rho_KLE(j2,z));
4022   
4023   EQ4_1(j2,z,t)$[VAO(j2,z) and CEO(j2,z)]..
4024                   VA(j2,z,t) =e= {[(1-beta_KLE2(j2,z))/(beta_KLE2(j2,z))]
4025                                *[PCE(j2,z,t)/PVA(j2,z,t)]}**sigma_KLE(j2,z)*CE(j2,z,t);
4026   
4027   EQ4(j,z,t)$[LDCO(j,z) and KDCO(j,z)]..
4028                   LDC(j,z,t) =e= {[beta_VA(j,z)/(1-beta_VA(j,z))]
4029                                *[RC(j,z,t)/WC(j,z,t)]}**sigma_VA(j,z)*KDC(j,z,t);
4030   
4031   EQ5(j,z,t)$LDCO(j,z)..
4032                   LDC(j,z,t) =e= LD(j,z,t)+LBS(j,z,t);
4033   
4034   EQ7(j,z,t)$KDCO(j,z)..
4035                   KDC(j,z,t) =e= B_KD(j,z)*SUM[k$KDO(k,j,z),beta_KD(k,j,z)
4036                                  *KD(k,j,z,t)**(-rho_KD(j,z))]**(-1/rho_KD(j,z))+sum(k,KBS(k,j,z,t));
4037   
4038   EQ8(k,j,z,t)$KDO(k,j,z)..
4039                   KD(k,j,z,t) =e= [beta_KD(k,j,z)*RC(j,z,t)/RTI(k,j,z,t)]
4040                                   **sigma_KD(j,z)*B_KD(j,z)**(sigma_KD(j,z)-1)
4041                                   *KDC(j,z,t);
4042   
4043   EQ9(nene,j,z,t)..   DI(nene,j,z,t) =e= aij(nene,j,z)*CI(j,z,t) ;
4044   
4045   EQ9_1(ene,j3,z,t)..  DE(ene,j3,z,t)   =e= aij2(ene,j3,z)*CE(j3,z,t)*AEEI(z,t) ;
4046   
4047  *=============================Simple Nesting=========================================
4048  * EQ9_2(ene,j2,z,t)..  DE(ene,j2,z,t) =e= [beta_ENER_t(ene,j2,z,t)*PCE(j2,z,t)/((P4(ene,j2,z,t)+P4(ene,j2,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene,j2,z,t)))]
4049  *                                   **sigma_ENER(j2,z)*B_ENER_t(j2,z,t)**(sigma_ENER(j2,z)-1)
4050  *                                   *CE(j2,z,t);
4051   
4052  *=============================Leontief===========================================
4053  * EQ9_2(j2,z,t)..       DEelec(j2,z,t)  =e= Share_Elec(j2,z)*CE(j2,z,t);
4054   
4055  * EQ9_3(j2,z,t)..       DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= (1-Share_Elec(j2,z))*CE(j2,z,t);
4056   
4057  * EQ9_4(ene3,j2,z,t)..  DE(ene3,j2,z,t) =e= Share_nElec(ene3,j2,z)*DEnelec(j2,z,t);
4058   
4059  * EQ9_5(ene2,j2,z,t)..  DE(ene2,j2,z,t) =e= DEelec(j2,z,t) ;
4060   
4061  *=============================Level 1, 2=======================================
4062  * EQ9_2(j2,z,t)..       CE(j2,z,t)  =e= B_ENER2(j2,z)*{[(beta_ENER2(j2,z))*DEelec(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER2(j2,z))]
4063  *                                                     +[(1-beta_ENER2(j2,z))*DEnelec(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER2(j2,z))]
4064  *                                                   }**(-1/rho_ENER2(j2,z));
4065   
4066  * EQ9_3(j2,z,t)..       DEelec(j2,z,t) =e= {[(beta_ENER2(j2,z))/(1-beta_ENER2(j2,z))]
4067  *                                        *[PCEnelec(j2,z,t)/PCEelec(j2,z,t)]}**sigma_ENER2(j2,z)*DEnelec(j2,z,t);
4068   
4069  * EQ9_4(ene3,j2,z,t)..  DE(ene3,j2,z,t) =e= [beta_ENER3(ene3,j2,z)*PCEnelec(j2,z,t)/P4(ene3,j2,z,t)]
4070  *                                            **sigma_ENER3(j2,z)*B_ENER3(j2,z)**(sigma_ENER3(j2,z)-1)
4071  *                                            *DEnelec(j2,z,t);
4072   
4073  * EQ9_5(ene2,j2,z,t)..  DE(ene2,j2,z,t) =e= DEelec(j2,z,t) ;
4074   
4075  *=============================Level 1, 2, 3 (Leonteif) =======================================
4076  * EQ9_2(j2,z,t)..        DEelec(j2,z,t)  =e= Share_Elec(j2,z)*CE(j2,z,t);
4077   
4078  * EQ9_3(j2,z,t)..        DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= (1-Share_Elec(j2,z))*CE(j2,z,t);
4079   
4080  * EQ9_4(j2,z,t)..        DEcoalgas(j2,z,t) =e= Share_coalgas2(j2,z)*DEnelec(j2,z,t);
4081   
4082  * EQ9_5(j2,z,t)..        DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) =e= (1-Share_coalgas2(j2,z))*DEnelec(j2,z,t);
4083   
4084  * EQ9_6(ene2,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene2,j2,z,t) =e= DEelec(j2,z,t) ;
4085   
4086  * EQ9_7(ene5,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene5,j2,z,t) =e= Share_coalgas(ene5,j2,z)*DEcoalgas(j2,z,t);
4087   
4088  * EQ9_8(ene6,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene6,j2,z,t) =e= Share_oilpetrol(ene6,j2,z)*DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t);
4089   
4090  *=============================Level 1, 2, 3 (CES) =======================================
4091   EQ9_2(j2,z,t)..        CE(j2,z,t)  =e= B_ENER_elec(j2,z)*{[(beta_ENER_elec(j2,z))*DEelec(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER_elec(j2,z))]
4092                                             +[(1-beta_ENER_elec(j2,z))*DEnelec(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER_elec(j2,z))]
4093                                              }**(-1/rho_ENER_elec(j2,z));
4094   
4095   EQ9_3(j2,z,t)..        DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= {[(1-beta_ENER_elec(j2,z))/(beta_ENER_elec(j2,z))]
4096                                          *[PCEelec(j2,z,t)/PCEnelec(j2,z,t)]}**sigma_ENER_elec(j2,z)*DEelec(j2,z,t);
4097   
4098   EQ9_4(j2,z,t)..        DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= B_ENER_fossil(j2,z)*{[(beta_ENER_fossil(j2,z))*DEcoalgas(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER_fossil(j2,z))]
4099                                             +[(1-beta_ENER_fossil(j2,z))*DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)**(-rho_ENER_fossil(j2,z))]
4100                                              }**(-1/rho_ENER_fossil(j2,z));
4101   
4102   EQ9_5(j2,z,t)..        DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) =e= {[(1-beta_ENER_fossil(j2,z))/(beta_ENER_fossil(j2,z))]
4103                                         *[PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t)/PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)]}**sigma_ENER_fossil(j2,z)*DEcoalgas(j2,z,t);
4104   
4105   EQ9_6(ene2,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene2,j2,z,t) =e= DEelec(j2,z,t)*AEEI(z,t) ;
4106   
4107   EQ9_7(ene5,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene5,j2,z,t) =e= [beta_ENER_coalgas(ene5,j2,z)*PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t)/(P4(ene5,j2,z,t)+P4(ene5,j2,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene5,j2,z,t))]
4108                                              **sigma_ENER_coalgas(j2,z)*B_ENER_coalgas(j2,z)**(sigma_ENER_coalgas(j2,z)-1)
4109                                              *DEcoalgas(j2,z,t)*AEEI(z,t);
4110   
4111   EQ9_8(ene6,j2,z,t)..   DE(ene6,j2,z,t) =e= [beta_ENER_oilprod(ene6,j2,z)*PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)/(P4(ene6,j2,z,t)+P4(ene6,j2,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene6,j2,z,t))]
4112                                              **sigma_ENER_oilprod(j2,z)*B_ENER_oilprod(j2,z)**(sigma_ENER_oilprod(j2,z)-1)
4113                                              *DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)*AEEI(z,t);
4114   
4115  *==============================================================================
4116  *   5.3.2 Income and savings
4117  *==============================================================================
4118  *    5.3.2.1 Households
4119  *==============================================================================
4120   EQ10(z,t)..       YH(z,t) =e= YHL(z,t)+YHK(z,t)+SUM(i3,MARKUP(i3,z,t))+REBATE(z,t)*recycle_hou(z,t) ;
4121   
4122   EQ11(z,t)..       YHL(z,t) =e= SUM[(j)$LDO(j,z),W(z,t)*LD(j,z,t)];
4123   
4124   EQ12(z,t)..       YHK(z,t) =e= SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),R(k,j,z,t)*KD(k,j,z,t)];
4125   
4126   EQ13(z,t)..       YDH(z,t) =e= YH(z,t)-TDH(z,t);
4127   
4128   EQ14(z,t)..       CTH(z,t) =e= YDH(z,t)-SH(z,t);
4129   
4130   EQ15(z,t)..       SH(z,t) =e= PIXCON(z,t)**eta*sh0(z,t)+sh1(z,t)*YDH(z,t);
4131   
4132  *==============================================================================
4133  *    5.3.2.2 Government
4134  *==============================================================================
4135   EQ16(z,t)..       YG(z,t) =e= TDH(z,t)+TPRODN(z,t)+TPRCTS(z,t)+REBATE(z,t)*recycle_gov(z,t);
4136   
4137   EQ16_1(z,t)..    TCTAX(z,t) =e= sum((ene,j), PC(ene,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene,j,z,t)*DE(ene,j,z,t));
4138   
4139   EQ17(z,t)..       TPRODN(z,t) =e= TIWT(z,t)+TIKT(z,t)+TIPT(z,t);
4140   
4141   EQ18(z,t)..       TIWT(z,t) =e= SUM[(j)$LDO(j,z),TIW(j,z,t)];
4142   
4143   EQ19(z,t)..       TIKT(z,t) =e= SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),TIK(k,j,z,t)];
4144   
4145   EQ20(z,t)..       TIPT(z,t) =e= SUM[j,TIP(j,z,t)];
4146   
4147   EQ21(z,t)..       TPRCTS(z,t) =e= TICT(z,t)+TIMT(z,t)+TIXT(z,t);
4148   
4149   EQ22(z,t)..       TICT(z,t) =e= SUM[i,TIC(i,z,t)];
4150   
4151   EQ23(z,t)..       TIMT(z,t) =e= SUM[(i,zj)$IMO(i,zj,z),TIM(i,zj,z,t)];
4152   
4153   EQ24(z,t)..       TIXT(z,t) =e= SUM[(i,zj)$EXO(i,z,zj),TIX(i,z,zj,t)];
4154   
4155   EQ25(z,t)..       TDH(z,t) =e= PIXCON(z,t)**eta*ttdh0(z,t)+ttdh1(z,t)*YH(z,t);
4156   
4157   EQ26(j,z,t)$LDO(j,z)..
4158                   TIW(j,z,t) =e= ttiw(j,z,t)*W(z,t)*LD(j,z,t) -LaborRebate(j,z,t);
4159   
4160   EQ27(k,j,z,t)$KDO(k,j,z)..
4161                   TIK(k,j,z,t) =e= ttik(k,j,z,t)*R(k,j,z,t)*KD(k,j,z,t);
4162   
4163   EQ28(j,z,t)..     TIP(j,z,t) =e= ttip(j,z,t)*PP(j,z,t)*XST(j,z,t);
4164   
4165   EQ29(i,z,t)..     TIC(i,z,t) =e= ttic(i,z,t)*{[PL(i,z,t)*DD(i,z,t)]$DDO(i,z)
4166                   +[SUM[zj$IMO(i,zj,z),(1+ttim(i,zj,z,t))*IM(i,zj,z,t)*e(z,t)
4167                    *(PWM(i,zj,z,t)+SUM(ij,PWMG(ij,t)*tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)))]]};
4168   
4169   EQ30(i,zj,z,t)$IMO(i,zj,z)..
4170                   TIM(i,zj,z,t) =e= ttim(i,zj,z,t)*IM(i,zj,z,t)*e(z,t)*
4171                                     (PWM(i,zj,z,t)+SUM[ij,PWMG(ij,t)
4172                                     *tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)]);
4173   
4174   EQ31(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4175                   TIX(i,z,zj,t) =e= ttix(i,z,zj,t)*PE(i,z,zj,t)*EX(i,z,zj,t);
4176   
4177   EQ32(z,t)..       SG(z,t) =e= YG(z,t)-G(z,t);
4178   
4179  *==============================================================================
4180  *    5.3.2.4 Rest of the world
4181  *==============================================================================
4182   EQ33(z,t)..       YROW(z,t) =e= e(z,t)*SUM{(i,zj)$IMO(i,zj,z),IM(i,zj,z,t)*
4183                             [PWM(i,zj,z,t)+SUM(ij,PWMG(ij,t)*tmrg(ij,i,zj,z))]};
4184   
4185   EQ34(z,t)..       SROW(z,t) =e= YROW(z,t)-e(z,t)*SUM[(i,zj)$EXO(i,z,zj),
4186                                 EX(i,z,zj,t)*PWX(i,z,zj,t)]-e(z,t)
4187                                 *SUM[i$MRGNO(i,z),MRGN(i,z,t)*PWMG(i,t)];
4188   
4189   EQ35(z,t)..       SROW(z,t) =e= -CAB(z,t);
4190   
4191  *==============================================================================
4192  *   5.3.3 Demand
4193  *==============================================================================
4194   EQ36(i,z,t)..  PC(i,z,t)*C(i,z,t) =e= PC(i,z,t) * (CMIN(i,z,t))
4195                         + gamma_LES(i,z) * {CTH(z,t) - SUM[ij, PC(ij,z,t) * (CMIN(ij,z,t) )]};
4196   
4197   EQ37(i,z,t)..     PC(i,z,t)*INV(i,z,t) =e= gamma_INV(i,z)*IT(z,t);
4198   
4199   EQ38(i,z,t)..     PC(i,z,t)*CG(i,z,t) =e= gamma_GVT(i,z)*G(z,t);
4200   
4201   EQ39(nene,z,t)..    DIT(nene,z,t) =e= SUM[j,DI(nene,j,z,t)];
4202   
4203   EQ39_1(ene1,z,t)..  DIT(ene1,z,t) =e= SUM[j,DE(ene1,j,z,t)];
4204   
4205   EQ39_2(ene2,z,t)..  DIT(ene2,z,t) =e= SUM[j,DE(ene2,j,z,t)];
4206   
4207  *==============================================================================
4208  *   5.3.4 International trade
4209  *==============================================================================
       EQB_1(i,z)..    XS_I(i,z) =e= B_X3(i,z)*SUM[j$XSO(j,i,z),beta_X3(j,i,z)
                                      *XS(j,i,z)**(-rho_X3(i,z))]**(-1/rho_X3(i,z));
       
       EQB_2(j,i,z)${DSO(j,i,z) and [DSO(j,i,z) ne DSO_I(i,z)]}..
                       XS(j,i,z) =e= XS_I(i,z)/B_X3(i,z)**(1-sigma_X3(i,z))*
                                     [beta_X3(j,i,z)*PI(i,z)/P2(j,i,z)]
                                     **sigma_X3(i,z);
       
       EQB_3(j,i,z)${DSO(j,i,z)}..   P2(j,i,z) =e= PT(j,z);
       
       EQB_4(j,i,z)$DSO(j,i,z)..
                       P2(j,i,z)*XS(j,i,z) =e= [PET(i,z)*EXTT(j,i,z)]$EXTTO(j,i,z)
                                              +[e(z)*MRGN(i,z)*PWMG(i)]$MRGNO(i,z)
                                              +[PL(i,z)*DS(j,i,z)]$DSO(j,i,z);
       
       EQB_5(j,i,z)$DSO(j,i,z)..  EXTT(j,i,z)  =e= theta2(j,i,z)*EXT(i,z);
4228   
4229  *[Top Nest - Leontief function]
4230   EQA_1(z,t)..  XS('18_TnD','18_ELEC',z,t) =e= TnDShare(z)*XS_I('18_ELEC',z,t);
4231   EQA_2(z,t)..  XS_I('18_ELEC',z,t) =e= XS('18_TnD','18_ELEC',z,t) + POWERQ(z,t);
4232   
4233   
4234  *[Second Nest - CES function]
4235  * EQA_3(z,t)..    POWERQ(z,t) =e= B_X4(z)*SUM[POWER, beta_X4(power,z)
4236  *                                *XS(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t)**(-rho_X4(z))]**(-1/rho_X4(z));
4237   EQA_3(z,t)..    POWERQ(z,t) =e= B_X4(z)*SUM[POWER, beta_X4(power,z)
4238                                  *XS(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t)**(-rho_X4(z))]**(-1/rho_X4(z));
4239   
4240  * EQA_4(power,'18_ELEC',z,t)..  XS(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t) =e= POWERQ(z,t)/B_X4(z)**(1-sigma_X4(z))*
4241  *                               [beta_X4(power,z)*PPOWER(z,t)/P2(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t)]
4242  *                               **sigma_X4(z);
4243   
4244   EQA_4(power,'18_ELEC',z,t)..  XS(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t) =e= POWERQ(z,t)/B_X4(z)**(1-sigma_X4(z))*
4245                                 [beta_X4(power,z)*PPOWER(z,t)/P2(POWER,'18_ELEC',z,t)]
4246                                 **sigma_X4(z);
4247   
4248  * exclude electiricity
4249   EQB_1(i2,z,t)..    XS_I(i2,z,t) =e= B_X3(i2,z)*SUM[j$XSO(j,i2,z),beta_X3(j,i2,z)
4250                                  *XS(j,i2,z,t)**(-rho_X3(i2,z))]**(-1/rho_X3(i2,z));
4251   
4252   
4253   EQB_3(j,i,z,t)${DSO(j,i,z)}..   P2(j,i,z,t) =e= PT(j,z,t);
4254   
4255   EQB_4(j,i,z,t)$DSO(j,i,z)..
4256                   P2(j,i,z,t)*XS(j,i,z,t) =e= [PET(i,z,t)*EXTT(j,i,z,t)]$EXTTO(j,i,z)
4257                                          +[e(z,t)*MRGN(i,z,t)*PWMG(i,t)]$MRGNO(i,z)
4258                                          +[PL(i,z,t)*DS(j,i,z,t)]$DSO(j,i,z);
4259   
4260   EQB_5(j,i,z,t)$DSO(j,i,z)..  EXTT(j,i,z,t)  =e= theta2(j,i,z)*EXT(i,z,t);
4261   
4262   EQ40_3(i,z,t)..   DS_I(i,z,t) =e= sum(j,DS(j,i,z,t)$DSO(j,i,z));
4263   
4264   EQ40_4(j,z,t)..   XST(j,z,t)  =e= sum(i,XS(j,i,z,t)$XSO(j,i,z));
4265   
4266   EQ40_5(i,z,t)..   XS_I(i,z,t) =e= B_X1(i,z)*{
4267                   [beta_EX_X1(i,z)*EXT(i,z,t)**rho_X1(i,z)]$EXTO(i,z)
4268                  +[beta_D_X1(i,z)*DS_I(i,z,t)**rho_X1(i,z)]$DSO_I(i,z)
4269                  +[(1-beta_EX_X1(i,z)-beta_D_X1(i,z))*MRGN(i,z,t)**rho_X1(i,z)]$MRGNO(i,z)
4270                                            }**(1/rho_X1(i,z));
4271   
4272   EQ41(i,z,t)$[EXTO(i,z) and DSO_I(i,z)]..
4273                   EXT(i,z,t) =e= {[beta_D_X1(i,z)/beta_EX_X1(i,z)]*[PET(i,z,t)/PL(i,z,t)]}
4274                                **sigma_X1(i,z)*DS_I(i,z,t);
4275   
4276   EQ42(i,z,t)$[MRGNO(i,z) and DSO_I(i,z)]..
4277                   MRGN(i,z,t) =e= {[beta_D_X1(i,z)/(1-beta_EX_X1(i,z)
4278                                   -beta_D_X1(i,z))]*[e(z,t)*PWMG(i,t)/PL(i,z,t)]}
4279                                   **sigma_X1(i,z)*DS_I(i,z,t);
4280   
4281   EQ43(i,z,t)$EXTO(i,z)..
4282                   EXT(i,z,t) =e= B_X2(i,z)*SUM[zj$EXO(i,z,zj),beta_X2(i,z,zj)
4283                                  *EX(i,z,zj,t)**rho_X2(i,z)]**(1/rho_X2(i,z));
4284   
4285   EQ44(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4286                   EX(i,z,zj,t) =e= EXT(i,z,t)/B_X2(i,z)**(1+sigma_X2(i,z))*
4287                                    [PE(i,z,zj,t)/(beta_X2(i,z,zj)*PET(i,z,t))]
4288                                    **sigma_X2(i,z);
4289   
4290   EQ45(i,z,t)..     Q(i,z,t) =e= B_M1(i,z)*{
4291                      [beta_M1(i,z)*IMT(i,z,t)**(-rho_M1(i,z))]$IMTO(i,z)
4292                     +[(1-beta_M1(i,z))*DD(i,z,t)**(-rho_M1(i,z))]$DDO(i,z)
4293                                          }**(-1/rho_M1(i,z));
4294   
4295   EQ46(i,z,t)$[IMTO(i,z) and DDO(i,z)]..
4296                   IMT(i,z,t) =e= {[beta_M1(i,z)/(1-beta_M1(i,z))]*[PD(i,z,t)
4297                                  /PMT(i,z,t)]}**sigma_m1(i,z)*DD(i,z,t);
4298   
4299   EQ47(i,z,t)$IMTO(i,z)..
4300                   IMT(i,z,t) =e= B_M2(i,z)*SUM[zj$IMO(i,zj,z),beta_M2(i,zj,z)*
4301                                  IM(i,zj,z,t)**(-rho_M2(i,z))]**(-1/rho_M2(i,z));
4302   
4303   EQ48(i,zj,z,t)$IMO(i,zj,z)..
4304                   IM(i,zj,z,t) =e= IMT(i,z,t)/B_M2(i,z)**(1-sigma_M2(i,z))*
4305                                    [beta_M2(i,zj,z)*PMT(i,z,t)/PM(i,zj,z,t)]
4306                                    **sigma_M2(i,z);
4307   
4308  *==============================================================================
4309  *   5.3.5 Prices
4310  *==============================================================================
4311   EQ49(j2,z,t)..       PP(j2,z,t)*XST(j2,z,t) =e= PKLE(j2,z,t)*KLE(j2,z,t)+PCI(j2,z,t)*CI(j2,z,t);
4312   
4313   EQ49_1(j3,z,t)..     PP(j3,z,t)*XST(j3,z,t) =e= PVA(j3,z,t)*VA(j3,z,t)+PCI(j3,z,t)*CI(j3,z,t)+PCE(j3,z,t)*CE(j3,z,t);
4314   
4315   EQ50(j,z,t)..        PT(j,z,t) =e= (1+ttip(j,z,t))*PP(j,z,t);
4316   
4317   EQ51(j,z,t)..        PCI(j,z,t)*CI(j,z,t) =e= SUM[nene,PC(nene,z,t)*DI(nene,j,z,t)];
4318   
4319  *Simple Nesting
4320  * EQ51_1(j,z,t)..    PCE(j,z,t)*CE(j,z,t) =e= SUM[ene,PC(ene,z,t)*DE(ene,j,z,t) + PC(ene,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene,j,z,t)*DE(ene,j,z,t)];
4321   
4322  *============================== Level 1-3 ========================================
4323  * EQ51_1(j2,z,t)..   PCE(j2,z,t)*CE(j2,z,t) =e= [PCEelec(j2,z,t)*DEelec(j2,z,t)+PCEnelec(j2,z,t)*DEnelec(j2,z,t)];
4324   
4325  * EQ51_12(j3,z,t)..  PCE(j3,z,t)*CE(j3,z,t) =e= SUM[ene,PC(ene,z,t)*DE(ene,j3,z,t)+PC(ene,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene,j3,z,t)*DE(ene,j3,z,t)];
4326   
4327  * EQ51_2(j2,z,t)..   PCEelec(j2,z,t)*DEelec(j2,z,t) =e= PC("18_ELEC",z,t)*DE("18_ELEC",j2,z,t);
4328   
4329  * EQ51_3(j2,z,t)..   PCEnelec(j2,z,t)*DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= SUM[ene3,PC(ene3,z,t)*DE(ene3,j2,z,t)+PC(ene3,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene3,j2,z,t)*DE(ene3,j2,z,t)];
4330   
4331  *================================= Level 1-5 ======================================
4332   EQ51_2(j3,z,t)..   PCE(j3,z,t)*CE(j3,z,t) =e= SUM[ene,PC(ene,z,t)*DE(ene,j3,z,t)+PC(ene,z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2(ene,j3,z,t)*DE(ene,j3,z,t)];
4333   
4334   EQ51_1(j2,z,t)..   PCE(j2,z,t)*CE(j2,z,t) =e= [PCEelec(j2,z,t)*DEelec(j2,z,t)+PCEnelec(j2,z,t)*DEnelec(j2,z,t)];
4335   
4336   EQ51_3(j2,z,t)..   PCEelec(j2,z,t)*DEelec(j2,z,t) =e= PC("18_ELEC",z,t)*DE("18_ELEC",j2,z,t);
4337   
4338   EQ51_4(j2,z,t)..   PCEnelec(j2,z,t)*DEnelec(j2,z,t) =e= [PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t)*DEcoalgas(j2,z,t)+PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)*DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)];
4339   
4340   EQ51_5(j2,z,t)..   PCEcoalgas(j2,z,t)*DEcoalgas(j2,z,t) =e= [PC("02_COAL",z,t)*DE("02_COAL",j2,z,t)+PC("02_COAL",z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2("02_COAL",j2,z,t)*DE("02_COAL",j2,z,t)
4341                      +PC("04_GAS",z,t)*DE("04_GAS",j2,z,t)+PC("04_GAS",z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2("04_GAS",j2,z,t)*DE("04_GAS",j2,z,t)];
4342   
4343   EQ51_6(j2,z,t)..   PCEoilpetrol(j2,z,t)*DEoilpetrol(j2,z,t) =e= [PC("03_OIL",z,t)*DE("03_OIL",j2,z,t)+PC("03_OIL",z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2("03_OIL",j2,z,t)*DE("03_OIL",j2,z,t)
4344                      +PC("10_PETROLCOAL",z,t)*DE("10_PETROLCOAL",j2,z,t)+PC("10_PETROLCOAL",z,t)*CTAX(z,t)*CO2FACTOR2("10_PETROLCOAL",j2,z,t)*DE("10_PETROLCOAL",j2,z,t)];
4345   
4346  *==================================================================================
4347   
4348   EQ52(j,z,t)..      PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t) =e= [WC(j,z,t)*LDC(j,z,t)]$LDCO(j,z)
4349                                       +[RC(j,z,t)*KDC(j,z,t)]$KDCO(j,z);
4350   
4351   EQ52_1(j2,z,t)..   PKLE(j2,z,t)*KLE(j2,z,t) =e= [PVA(j2,z,t)*VA(j2,z,t)]$VAO(j2,z)
4352                                         +[PCE(j2,z,t)*CE(j2,z,t)]$CEO(j2,z);
4353   
4354  * Given equations 5 and 6, equation 53 is redundant
4355  * EQ53(j,z)..     WC(j,z)*LDC(j,z) =e= SUM[l$LDO(l,j,z),WTI(l,j,z)*LD(l,j,z)];
4356   EQ53(j,z,t)..     WC(j,z,t)*LDC(j,z,t) =e= WTI(j,z,t)*LD(j,z,t);
4357   
4358   EQ54(j,z,t)$LDO(j,z)..
4359                   WTI(j,z,t)*LD(j,z,t) =e= W(z,t)*(1+ttiw(j,z,t))*LD(j,z,t) -LaborRebate(j,z,t);
4360   
4361   EQ54_1(ene,j2,z,t)$DEO(ene,j2,z)..
4362                   P4(ene,j2,z,t) =e= PC(ene,z,t);
4363   
4364  * Given equations 7 and 8, equation 55 is redundant
4365  * EQ55(j,z)$(kmob and KDCO(j,z))..
4366  *                 RC(j,z)*KDC(j,z) =e= SUM[k$KDO(k,j,z),RTI(k,j,z)*KD(k,j,z)];
4367   
4368   EQ56(k,j,z,t)$KDO(k,j,z)..
4369                   RTI(k,j,z,t) =e= R(k,j,z,t)*(1+ttik(k,j,z,t));
4370   
4371  * EQ57(k,j,z,t)$(kmob and KDO(k,j,z))..
4372  *                 R(k,j,z,t) =e= RK(k,z,t);
4373   
4374   EQ58(i,z,t)..     P(i,z,t)*XS_I(i,z,t) =e= [PL(i,z,t)*DS_I(i,z,t)]$DSO_I(i,z)
4375                                       +[PET(i,z,t)*EXT(i,z,t)]$EXTO(i,z)
4376                                       +[e(z,t)*PWMG(i,t)*MRGN(i,z,t)]$MRGNO(i,z);
4377   
4378  * Given equations 43 and 44, equation 59 is redundant
4379  * EQ59(i,z)$EXTO(i,z)..
4380  *                 PET(i,z)*EXT(i,z) =e= SUM[zj$EXO(i,z,zj),
4381  *                                           PE(i,z,zj)*EX(i,z,zj);
4382   
4383   EQ60(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4384                   PE(i,z,zj,t)*(1+ttix(i,z,zj,t)) =e= e(z,t)*PWX(i,z,zj,t);
4385   
4386   EQ61(i,z,t)$DDO(i,z)..
4387                   PD(i,z,t) =e= (1+ttic(i,z,t))*PL(i,z,t);
4388   
4389   EQ62(i,zj,z,t)$IMO(i,zj,z)..
4390                   PM(i,zj,z,t) =e= (1+ttic(i,z,t))*(1+ttim(i,zj,z,t))*e(z,t)*
4391                                    (PWM(i,zj,z,t)+SUM[ij,PWMG(ij,t)
4392                                    *tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)]);
4393   
4394  * Given equations 47 and 48, equation 63 is redundant
4395  * EQ63(i,z)$IMTO(i,z)..
4396  *                 PMT(i,z)*IMT(i,z) =e= SUM[zj$IMO(i,zj,z),
4397  *                                           PM(i,zj,z)*IM(i,zj,z);
4398   
4399   EQ64(i,z,t)..     PC(i,z,t)*Q(i,z,t) =e= [PD(i,z,t)*DD(i,z,t)]$DDO(i,z)+
4400                                      [PMT(i,z,t)*IMT(i,z,t)]$IMTO(i,z);
4401   
4402  * EQ65(z,t)..       PK(z,t) =e= 1/A_K(z)*PROD[i$gamma_INV(i,z),(PC(i,z,t)
4403  *                               /gamma_INV(i,z))**gamma_INV(i,z)];
4404   
4405   EQ66(z,t)..       PIXGDP(z,t) =e=
4406                   {SUM[j,{(PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t)+TIP(j,z,t))/VA(j,z,t)}*VAO(j,z)]
4407                   /SUM[j,{(PVAO(j,z)*VAO(j,z)+TIPO(j,z))/VAO(j,z)}*VAO(j,z)]
4408                   *SUM[j,{(PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t)+TIP(j,z,t))/VA(j,z,t)}*VA(j,z,t)]
4409                   /SUM[j,{(PVAO(j,z)*VAO(j,z)+TIPO(j,z))/VAO(j,z)}*VA(j,z,t)]}**0.5;
4410   
4411   EQ67(t)..         PIXGDP_W(t) =e=
4412                   {SUM[(j,z),{(PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t)+TIP(j,z,t))/VA(j,z,t)}*VAO(j,z)/e(z,t)]
4413                   /SUM[(j,z),{(PVAO(j,z)*VAO(j,z)+TIPO(j,z))/VAO(j,z)}*VAO(j,z)/eO(z)]
4414                   *SUM[(j,z),{(PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t)+TIP(j,z,t))/VA(j,z,t)}*VA(j,z,t)/e(z,t)]
4415                   /SUM[(j,z),{(PVAO(j,z)*VAO(j,z)+TIPO(j,z))/VAO(j,z)}*VA(j,z,t)/eO(z)]}**0.5;
4416   
4417   EQ68(z,t)..       PIXCON(z,t) =e= SUM[i,PC(i,z,t)*CO(i,z)]/SUM[i,PCO(i,z)*CO(i,z)];
4418   
4419   EQ69(z,t)..       PIXINV(z,t) =e= PROD[i$gamma_INV(i,z),(PC(i,z,t)/PCO(i,z))
4420                                   **gamma_INV(i,z)];
4421   
4422   EQ70(z,t)..       PIXGVT(z,t) =e= PROD[i$gamma_GVT(i,z),(PC(i,z,t)/PCO(i,z))
4423                                   **gamma_GVT(i,z)];
4424   
4425  *==============================================================================
4426  *   5.3.6 Equilibrium
4427  *==============================================================================
4428   EQ71(i1,z,t)..    Q(i1,z,t) =e= C(i1,z,t)+CG(i1,z,t)+INV(i1,z,t)+DIT(i1,z,t);
4429   
4430   EQ71_2(i3,z,t)..  Q(i3,z,t) =e= C_Conventional(i3,z,t);
4431   
4432   EQ72(z,t)..       LS(z,t) =e= SUM[j$LDO(j,z),LD(j,z,t)+LBS(j,z,t)];
4433   
4434   EQ73(k,z,t)$KSO(k,z)..
4435                     KS(k,z,t) =e= SUM[j$KDO(k,j,z),KD(k,j,z,t)+KBS(k,j,z,t)];
4436   
4437   EQ74(z,t)..       IT(z,t) =e= SH(z,t)+SG(z,t)-CAB(z,t);
4438   
4439   EQ75(z,t)..       DEP(z,t) =e= PK(z,t)*delta(z)*SUM[k$KSO(k,z),KS(k,z,t)];
4440   
4441   EQ76(i,z,t)$DDO(i,z)..
4442                     SUM[j$DSO(j,i,z),DS(j,i,z,t)] =e= DD(i,z,t);
4443   
4444   EQ77(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4445                     EX(i,z,zj,t) =e= IM(i,z,zj,t);
4446   
4447   EQ78(i,z,zj,t)$EXO(i,z,zj)..
4448                     PWX(i,z,zj,t) =e= PWM(i,z,zj,t);
4449   
4450   EQ79(i,t)..       SUM[z$MRGNO(i,z),MRGN(i,z,t)] =e= SUM[(z,zj,ij)$IMO(ij,zj,z),
4451                                                   tmrg(i,ij,zj,z)*IM(ij,zj,z,t)];
4452   
4453  * Given equations 33, 34 and 77, equation 80 is redundant
4454  *EQ80..          SUM[z,SROW(z,t)/e(z,t)] =e= 0;
4455   
4456  *==============================================================================
4457  *   5.3.7 Gross domestic product
4458  *==============================================================================
4459   EQ81(z,t)..       GDP_BP(z,t) =e= SUM[j,PVA(j,z,t)*VA(j,z,t)]+TIPT(z,t);
4460   
4461   EQ82(z,t)..       GDP_MP(z,t) =e= GDP_BP(z,t)+TPRCTS(z,t);
4462   
4463   EQ83(z,t)..       GDP_IB(z,t) =e= SUM[(j)$LDO(j,z),W(z,t)*LD(j,z,t)]
4464                                +SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),R(k,j,z,t)*KD(k,j,z,t)]
4465                                +TPRCTS(z,t)+TPRODN(z,t);
4466   
4467   EQ84(z,t)..       GDP_FD(z,t) =e=
4468                                   SUM[i,PC(i,z,t)*(C(i,z,t)+CG(i,z,t)+INV(i,z,t))]
4469                                  +SUM[(i,zj)$EXO(i,z,zj),e(z,t)*PWX(i,z,zj,t)*EX(i,z,zj,t)]
4470                                  +SUM[i$MRGNO(i,z),e(z,t)*PWMG(i,t)*MRGN(i,z,t)]
4471                                  -SUM[(i,zj)$IMO(i,zj,z),e(z,t)*IM(i,zj,z,t)
4472                                      *(PWM(i,zj,z,t)+SUM[ij,PWMG(ij,t)*tmrg(ij,i,zj,z)])]
4473                                  -TCTAX(z,t) -SUM(i3,MARKUP(i3,z,t));
4474  * GDP_MP, GDP_IB, GDP_FD
4475   
4476   EQ85(t)..          GDP_BP_W(t) =e= SUM[z,GDP_BP(z,t)/e(z,t)];
4477   
4478  *==============================================================================
4479  *  5.3.8 Real (volume) variables computed from price indices
4480  *==============================================================================
4481   EQ86(z,t)..       CTH_REAL(z,t) =e= CTH(z,t)/PIXCON(z,t);
4482   
4483   EQ87(z,t)..       G_REAL(z,t) =e= G(z,t)/PIXGVT(z,t);
4484   
4485   EQ88(z,t)..       GDP_BP_REAL(z,t) =e= GDP_BP(z,t)/PIXGDP(z,t);
4486   
4487   EQ89(t)..         GDP_BP_W_REAL(t) =e= GDP_BP_W(t)/PIXGDP_W(t);
4488   
4489   EQ90(z,t)..       GDP_MP_REAL(z,t) =e= GDP_MP(z,t)/PIXCON(z,t);
4490   
4491   EQ91(z,t)..       IT_REAL(z,t) =e= IT(z,t)/PIXINV(z,t);
4492   
4493   EQ92(z,t)..       CABX(z,t) =e= CAB(z,t)/[PIXGDP_W(t)*e(z,t)];
4494   
4495  *==============================================================================
4496  *   5.3.8 Dynamic equations
4497  *==============================================================================
4498   EQ94(z,t)..     IT(z,t) =e= PK(z,t)*SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),IND(k,j,z,t)];
4499   
4500   EQ95(z,t)..     PK(z,t) =e= 1/A_K(z)*PROD[i$gamma_INV(i,z),(PC(i,z,t)
4501                                 /gamma_INV(i,z))**gamma_INV(i,z)];
4502   
4503   EQ96(k,bus,z,t)$KDO(k,bus,z)..
4504                       IND(k,bus,z,t) =e= phi(z,t)*[R(k,bus,z,t)/U(z,t)]
4505                                    **sigma_INV(k,bus,z)*KD(k,bus,z,t);
4506   
4507   EQ97a(z,t)..    IR(z,t) =e= {SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),
4508                                R(k,j,z,t)*KD(k,j,z,t)]-DEP(z,t)}/
4509                               {PK(z,t)*SUM[(k,j)$KDO(k,j,z),KD(k,j,z,t)]};
4510   
4511   EQ97b(z,t)..    U(z,t) =e= PK(z,t)*(delta(z)+IR(z,t));
4512   
4513  *==============================================================================
4514  *   5.3.9 Other
4515  *==============================================================================
4516   WALRAS(z,t)..   LEON(z,t) =e= Q('01_AGRICULT',z,t)-C('01_AGRICULT',z,t)-CG('01_AGRICULT',z,t)-INV('01_AGRICULT',z,t)
4517                              -DIT('01_AGRICULT',z,t);
4518   
4519  *==============================================================================
4520  *   5.3.10 Backstop technology
4521  *==============================================================================
4522   EQ98(i3,z,t)..    C_Conventional(i3,z,t) =e= (1-penetration_rate(i3,z,t))*[C(i3,z,t)+CG(i3,z,t)+INV(i3,z,t)+DIT(i3,z,t)];
4523   
4524   EQ99(i3,z,t)..    XDBS(i3,z,t) =e= penetration_rate(i3,z,t)*[C(i3,z,t)+CG(i3,z,t)+INV(i3,z,t)+DIT(i3,z,t)];
4525   
4526   EQ100(j,z,t)..    XDBS2(j,z,t) =e= sum{i3$COMtoIND(j,i3),XDBS(i3,z,t)};
4527   
4528   EQ101(j,z,t)..    LBS(j,z,t) =e= Lab_Share(j,z)*XDBS2(j,z,t);
4529   
4530   EQ102(k,j,z,t)..  KBS(k,j,z,t) =e= Cap_Share(j,z)*XDBS2(j,z,t)*KDO(k,j,z)/sum(kj,KDO(kj,j,z));
4531   
4532   EQ103(i3,z,t)..   CLBS(i3,z,t)  =e= sum{j$INDtoCOM(i3,j),LBS(j,z,t)*WC(j,z,t)};
4533   
4534   EQ104(i3,z,t)..   CKBS(i3,z,t)  =e= sum{k,sum{j$INDtoCOM(i3,j),KBS(k,j,z,t)*RC(j,z,t)}};
4535   
4536   EQ105(i3,z,t)..   MARKUP(i3,z,t) =e= {PC(i3,z,t)*XDBS(i3,z,t)-CLBS(i3,z,t)-CKBS(i3,z,t)} ;
4537   
4538  *================================================================================
4539  * 6 Labour Supply
4540  *================================================================================
4541   EQ106(z,t)..  LS(z,t) =e= LST(z,t) *((W(z,t)/PIXCON(z,t)) / (W_lag(z,t)/PIXCON_lag(z,t)))**elasLS(z);
4542   
4543  *==============================================================================
4544  * 7 PERMET
4545  *==============================================================================
4546   EQ107(j,z,t).. PERMIT(j,z,t) =e= sum(ene, CO2FACTOR2(ene,j,z,t)*DE(ene,j,z,t));
4547   
4548   EQ108(z,t)..  PERMIT_TOTAL(z,t) =e=  sum(j,PERMIT(j,z,t))  ;
4549   
4550   EQ108_1(t).. PERMIT_NEA_TOTAL(t) =e= sum(NEA, PERMIT_TOTAL(NEA,t));
4551   
4552  *==============================================================================
4553  * 8 Carbon Tax Revenue Recycling
4554  *==============================================================================
4555  EQ109(z,t)..     REBATE(z,t) =e= TCTAX(z,t);
4556   
4557  EQ110(j,z,t)..   TIW_Share(j,z,t) =e= LD(j,z,t)/SUM(jj,LD(jj,z,t));
4558   
4559  EQ111(j,z,t)..   LaborRebate(j,z,t) =e= TIW_Share(j,z,t) * TCTAX(z,t) * recycle_labor(z,t);
4560   
4561  EQ112(j,z,t)..   TIK_Share(j,z,t) =e= KD('cap',j,z,t)/SUM(jj,KD('cap',jj,z,t));
4562   
4563  EQ113(j,z,t)..   ttik('cap',j,z,t) =e= ttik_lag(j,z,t) + deltatik(j,z,t);
4564   
4565  EQ114(j,z,t)..   deltatik(j,z,t) =e= -TIK_Share(j,z,t)*REBATE(z,t)/(R('cap',j,z,t)*KD('cap',j,z,t))*recycle_capital(z,t);
4566   
4567  EQ115(j,z,t)..   TIP_Share(j,z,t) =e= XST(j,z,t)/SUM(jj,XST(jj,z,t));
4568   
4569  EQ116(j,z,t)..   ttip(j,z,t) =e= ttip_lag(j,z,t) + deltatip(j,z,t);
4570   
4571  EQ117(j,z,t)..   deltatip(j,z,t) =e= -TIP_Share(j,z,t) * REBATE(z,t) / (PP(j,z,t)*XST(j,z,t))*recycle_ptax(z,t);
4572   
4573  *==============================================================================
4574  * 6 Numerical resolution to compute A_VA, sh0, G, G_REAL and IND
4575  *==============================================================================
4576  option cns = conopt4;
4577  *option cns = path;
4578  *option cns = minos;
4579   
4580  *option conopt4.TolPiv = 1e-6;
4581  *option iterlim = 100;
4582  *option reslim = 1000;
4583  *option iterlim = 0;
4584  *option lmmxsf = t ;
4585   
4586  *Eliminating display of solution makes it easier to check whether model solves
4587  *and to identify year when it crashes.
4588  *option profile=1;
4589  *option profile=3;
4590  *option profiletol=10;
4591   
4592  *Fast solve option
4593  option profile=0;
4594  option limrow=0, limcol=0, solprint = off;

